PRETABLE 18 -- written 2026-10-16 BEFORE table 18 runs (its own file; this mtime orders table 18 alone).
Instrument: the v21 CANDIDATE (m88k_exc_probe_v21cand.FROZEN.py) -- v20 plus the delay-slot CLASS CLOSURE: five rows.
It is a candidate, not the working tree, because pass-14 seats were still reading v20 when it was built; whether any of
its cells is floor is the pass-14 adjudication's call.  Base: HEAD 7b23b785.

THE CLASS, from the function's own inputs: m88k_exception() tests cpu->delay_slot (840, and 865 whose result X(br_n)
consumes at cpu_m88k_instr.c:99 to choose the exception vector over the branch target).  Sites: the seven switch-1
arms, the fallback (799), the SFRZ re-route's non-trap and trap sides (811/816).  10 cells.  v20 rows 5 (DIV0, MISALIGN,
UNIMPL, PRIV, OVF).  v21 adds:

  SIBLING PARITY / CLAIM -> ROW / CHANNEL, per new row:
  dslotbounds     [br.n +16, tb1 0,r3,7] r3=1, fault 0x10008, entry 0x38, else-arm shadows as implemented
                  kills M_DSNOT_BOUNDS (`implemented = !cpu->delay_slot' at BOUNDS): fallback HALT replaces DELIVER
  dsloterror      [br.n +16, tb1 0,r3,10] r3=1, fault 0x10008, entry 0x50
                  kills M_DSNOT_ERROR: HALT replaces DELIVER
  errdslot        first fault divu by zero; frozen handler at 0x40 = [br.n +16, ld r6,r5,0] r5 odd -> re-routed to ERROR 0x50,
                  frozen shadows, refatal present
                  kills M_RRNTDS (`if (!is_trap && !cpu->delay_slot)'): delivered to MISALIGN 0x20 instead -> STOP
  trapfrozendslot first fault divu by zero; frozen handler = [br.n +16, tb1 0,r3,7] r3=0x11 -> exempt, 0x38, no refatal
                  kills M_RRTDS (`if (!is_trap || cpu->delay_slot)'): re-routed to ERROR 0x50 -> STOP
  usfu1dslot      [stcr r5,cr1 (user, SFD1 set), br.n +16, divu r6,r5,r4] -> SFU1 (114) in a slot -> fallback HALT naming 0x072
                  kills M_FBDS (`... && !implemented && !cpu->delay_slot'): no halt -> TAILHALT or a delivery, never HALT

  GUARD FIELD vs BODY FIELD: delay_slot partition {0, nonzero}; EXHAUSTED at all 10 cells after v21.

