   BASE                 68/68
   M_DSNOT_MISALIGN     66/68  dslotmisalign, errdslot (errdslot's frozen slot fault enters the MISALIGN arm before the re-route)
   M_DSNOT_UNIMPL       67/68  dslotunimpl
